    "name": "MOGA Festival",
    "id": "moga-festival",
    "description": "A boutique electronic music, art, and wellness festival held annually on the Atlantic coast of Essaouira, blending international and Moroccan DJs with traditional Moroccan culture. A free city program (MOGA OFF) precedes the main ticketed festival weekend (MOGA IN).",
